  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_039) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.724989). This experiment tests whether switching the RNA encoder to scgpt (while keeping image encoder, aggregation, and fusion unchanged) improves performance. This isolates the impact of RNA encoder choice, a key design decision, and explores potential gains from a different encoder architecture without altering other high-performing components."
